<section aria-labelledby="lp-feature-heading" class="lp-feature px-md-0 px-3">
<div class="container">
<div class="lp-feature-card">
<div class="lp-feature-image"><img alt="" height="420" src="https://www.slcc.edu/_redesign/_files/images/2026-redesign/beyond-the-podium-home-photo.webp" width="600"/></div>
<div class="lp-feature-text">
<p class="lp-feature-kicker">US Speedskating | US Ski &amp; Snowboard | USA Climbing</p>
<h2 class="section-h2" id="lp-feature-heading">Beyond the Podium</h2>
<p>Beyond the Podium helps elite student-athletes balance Olympic ambitions with higher-ed goals, career counseling, and planning for life after competition ends.</p>
<a class="arrow-btn btn btn-yellow text-uppercase rounded-pill px-5 fw-bold py-2" href="https://www.slcc.edu/beyondthepodium/">Learn More<span class="visually-hidden"> about Beyond the Podium</span></a>
