<div class="lp-band-head mb-5">
<h2 class="section-h2 mb-0">Latest News</h2>
<a class="lp-circle-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/newsroom//index.html"> <i class="fa-light fa-circle-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="visually-hidden">All news</span></a>
</div>
<!-- home-2026 news: link=site://Newsroom/2026/11/slcc-selected-for-prestigious-howard-hughes-medical-institute-undergraduate-science-scholars-program image=site://Newsroom/post_images/111726_1.webp -->
<article class="latest-news-card d-flex bg-white flex-md-row flex-column">
<div class="latest-news-card-image flex-shrink-0"><img alt="" class="img-fluid" height="220" src="https://www.slcc.edu/newsroom//post_images/111726_1.webp" width="390"/></div>
<div class="latest-news-card-content p-4">
<div class="latest-news-card-content-title p-2">
<h3><a href="https://www.slcc.edu/newsroom//2026/11/slcc-selected-for-prestigious-howard-hughes-medical-institute-undergraduate-science-scholars-program.html">SLCC Selected for Prestigious Howard Hughes Medical Institute Undergraduate Science Scholars Program</a></h3>
<p>Salt Lake Community College has been selected as one of only nine community colleges nationwide to participate in the inaugural Howard Hughes Medical Institute (HHMI) Undergraduate Science Scholars Program, a new initiative designed to support talented community college students pursuing careers in the life sciences.</p>
<a class="lp-read-more" href="https://www.slcc.edu/newsroom//2026/11/slcc-selected-for-prestigious-howard-hughes-medical-institute-undergraduate-science-scholars-program.html">Read More<span class="visually-hidden">: SLCC Selected for Prestigious Howard Hughes Medical Institute Undergraduate Science Scholars Program</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-5 mt-lg-0 mt-5">
<div class="lp-band-head mb-lg-5 mb-4">
<h2 class="section-h2 mb-0">Upcoming Events</h2>
<a class="lp-circle-link" href="https://calendar.slcc.edu/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"> <i class="fa-light fa-circle-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="visually-hidden">All events (opens in a new window)</span></a>
</div>
<div class="upcoming-events">

<div id="localist-widget-74812740" class="localist-widget"></div>
<script defer type="text/javascript"
src="https://calendar.slcc.edu/widget/view?schools=saltlake&exclude_types=47827%2C48068&days=31&num=3&experience=inperson&container=localist-widget-74812740&template=slcc-2026-landing"></script>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="lp-testimonials" class="testimonialsSection">
<div class="container-lg">
<h2 class="section-h2 text-center mb-5" id="lp-testimonials">Student Testimonials</h2>
<ul class="testimonials-slider lp-testimonials" id="lp-test-list">
<li class="lp-test">
<article class="lp-test-card">
<img alt="" class="lp-test-img" height="600" src="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/images/ysabel_lonazco.webp" width="1200"/>
<div class="lp-test-body">
<h3>Ysabel Lonazco</h3>
<p class="lp-test-cred">AAS, Legal Studies</p>
<blockquote><p>"I was learning from lawyers, prosecutors, judges  &#8212;  they inspired me and really encouraged me. They saw more than what I saw in myself."</p></blockquote>
<p class="lp-test-more"><a class="lp-test-link stretched-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/ysabel-lonazco.aspx">Then and Now<span class="visually-hidden">: Ysabel Lonazco's story</span></a></p>
</div>
</article>
</li>
<li class="lp-test">
<article class="lp-test-card">
<img alt="" class="lp-test-img" height="600" src="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/images/demetrius-daniels.webp" width="1200"/>
<div class="lp-test-body">
<h3>Demetrius Daniels</h3>
<p class="lp-test-cred">AA, Business Degree</p>
<blockquote><p>"I knew if I wanted to pursue an ambitious career path, college was the way. SLCC was close to home, affordable, and it was financially doable for me."</p></blockquote>
<p class="lp-test-more"><a class="lp-test-link stretched-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/demetrius-daniels.aspx">Then and Now<span class="visually-hidden">: Demetrius Daniels's story</span></a></p>
</div>
</article>
</li>
<li class="lp-test">
<article class="lp-test-card">
<img alt="" class="lp-test-img" height="600" src="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/images/glory_shekinah_stanton.webp" width="1200"/>
<div class="lp-test-body">
<h3>Glory Shekinah Stanton</h3>
<p class="lp-test-cred">AA, General Studies &amp; Pre-Med</p>
<blockquote><p>"I wanted smaller classes with professors who were easily accessible, approachable and supportive."</p></blockquote>
<p class="lp-test-more"><a class="lp-test-link stretched-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/glory-shekinah-stanton.aspx">Then and Now<span class="visually-hidden">: Glory Shekinah Stanton's story</span></a></p>
</div>
</article>
</li>
<li class="lp-test">
<article class="lp-test-card">
<img alt="" class="lp-test-img" height="600" src="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/images/hailey_brohamer.webp" width="1200"/>
<div class="lp-test-body">
<h3>Hailey Brohamer</h3>
<p class="lp-test-cred">AAS, Diesel Systems Technology</p>
<blockquote><p>"Going into this field was one of the hardest and most rewarding things I've ever done. If you have determination and drive, companies will hire you in a heartbeat."</p></blockquote>
<p class="lp-test-more"><a class="lp-test-link stretched-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/hailey-brohamer.aspx">Then and Now<span class="visually-hidden">: Hailey Brohamer's story</span></a></p>
</div>
</article>
</li>
<li class="lp-test">
<article class="lp-test-card">
<img alt="" class="lp-test-img" height="600" src="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/images/alys_hobbs.webp" width="1200"/>
<div class="lp-test-body">
<h3>Alys Hobbs</h3>
<p class="lp-test-cred">Aviation Maintenance</p>
<blockquote><p>"You're never too old to go back to school. Just jump on it. If you don't know where to start, just start small and take a few classes towards your associates."</p></blockquote>
<p class="lp-test-more"><a class="lp-test-link stretched-link" href="https://www.slcc.edu/photostory/alys-hobbs.aspx">Then and Now<span class="visually-hidden">: Alys Hobbs's story</span></a></p>
</div>
</article>
</li>
</ul>

<script>
(function () {
  var list = document.getElementById('lp-test-list');
  if (!list) { return; }
  var keep = 3;
  var items = Array.prototype.slice.call(list.children);
  if (items.length <= keep) { return; }
  for (var i = items.length - 1; i > 0; i = i - 1) {
    var j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
    var t = items[i];
    items[i] = items[j];
    items[j] = t;
  }
  for (var k = 0; k < items.length; k = k + 1) {
    if (k < keep) { list.appendChild(items[k]); } else { list.removeChild(items[k]); }
  }
})();
