<section aria-labelledby="fast-facts-heading" class="fastFactsSection">
<div class="container-lg">
<h2 class="section-h2 text-center mb-5" id="fast-facts-heading">Fast Facts</h2>
<ul class="facts-grid">
<li class="fact-card fact-card-blue"><div class="fact-card-content"><h3>Utah's most diverse student body</h3><p>SLCC has the most diverse student body of any higher education institution in the state.</p></div></li>
<li aria-hidden="true" class="fact-card fact-card-image"><img alt="" src="https://www.slcc.edu/_redesign/_files/images/2026-redesign/home-top-img-new.jpg"/></li>
<li class="fact-card fact-card-brown"><div class="fact-card-content"><h3>19</h3><p>Average class size</p></div></li>
<li aria-hidden="true" class="fact-card fact-card-image-tall"><img alt="" src="https://www.slcc.edu/_redesign/_files/images/2026-redesign/testimonial-one-new.jpg"/></li>
<li class="fact-card fact-card-light-blue"><div class="fact-card-content"><h3>36,000+ students</h3><p>take classes for college credit at SLCC each year, choosing from 120+ certificates and degrees in 8 areas of study.</p></div></li>
<li class="fact-card fact-card-yellow"><div class="fact-card-content"><h3>70% transfer</h3><p>of SLCC students who graduate with an AA, AS or APE transfer to a four-year institution.</p></div></li>
</ul>
<div class="text-center mt-5">
<a class="arrow-btn btn btn-yellow text-uppercase rounded-pill px-5 fw-bold py-2" href="https://www.slcc.edu/about-landing.aspx">About SLCC</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
